OL,3,AMan dies near Notting Hill Carnival
OL,4,Aafter entering canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died near Notting Hill
OL,7,FCarnival in London on Monday afternoon,
OL,8,Fthe Metropolitan Police have confirmed.
OL,10,FPolice officers had attempted to stop
OL,11,Fthe man, believed to be in his 20s, as
OL,12,Fhe approached the event. He fled on
OL,13,Ffoot with officers in pursuit, and
OL,14,Fentered the water in the vicinity of
OL,15,FMeanwhile Gardens a short time later,
OL,16,Fthe force said.
OL,18,FThe man was taken to hospital by
OL,19,Fambulance and was pronounced dead a
OL,20,Fshort time later.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
