OL,3,AMan dies near Notting Hill Carnival
OL,4,Aafter entering canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FCdr Claire Smart said: "This is a
OL,7,Ftragic incident and our thoughts are
OL,8,Fwith the loved ones of the man who has
OL,9,Flost his life."
